<title>ITALY: Italy Senate to vote on economic plan on June 20.</title>
<headline>Italy Senate to vote on economic plan on June 20.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian Senate (upper house) will vote on the government's three-year programme of economic targets on Friday, June 20, parliamentary party leaders said.</p>
<p>The Senate's examination of the plan, which was unveiled last Friday and is known as the DPEF, was due to begin on Wednesday with an address by Treasury Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi to the upper house's budget commission.</p>
<p>Ciampi was expected to speak at around 1200 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
